// Regression test for GitHub issue #253 ("Undetected infinite multi-objective reward").
// The only behaviour is a self-loop earning reward 1 per step, so the minimum total
// reward is infinite. Multi-objective LP used to report 0 (and value iteration failed
// to converge); an upper bound on the reward can never be met.

mdp

module infinite
	s : [0..1];

	[inf] s=0 -> true;
endmodule

rewards "inf"
	[inf] true : 1;
endrewards
